1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,820
This fire burned for almost three years,

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,660
until the Soviets nuked it.

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,420
Why not just plug the well?

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,340
They tried, but the gas,

5
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,660
enough for a whole city every day,

6
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,980
just escaped into nearby wells.

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,340
So they set off a nuke

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,180
almost a mile underground,

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,700
right beside the well.

10
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,220
The blast squeezed the rock

11
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,660
and pinched the well shut,

12
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,180
like stepping on a hose.

13
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,340
Fire out in twenty-three seconds.
